(EXPLODING KITTENS - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Exploding Kittens is a card game of luck and timing. If you draw an Exploding Kitten) Tj T*
(and can not defuse it, you are out. The last player left wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Remove the Exploding Kittens and Defuse cards from the deck. Deal 7 cards to each) Tj T*
(player and give each player 1 Defuse card. Put Exploding Kittens back into the deck:) Tj T*
(one fewer than the number of players. Put the remaining Defuse cards back too \(only 2) Tj T*
(of them with 2 or 3 players\). Shuffle.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Play as many cards as you want from your hand, or none. Then draw the top card of the) Tj T*
(deck; this ends your turn.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(EXPLODING KITTEN) Tj T*
(If you draw an Exploding Kitten, play a Defuse card and secretly put the kitten back) Tj T*
(anywhere in the deck. Without a Defuse you explode and leave the game.) Tj T*
ET
