(ACTION CARDS) Tj T*
(- Attack: end your turn without drawing; the next player takes 2 turns.) Tj T*
(- Skip: end your turn without drawing.) Tj T*
(- Favor: one player must give you a card of their choice.) Tj T*
(- Shuffle: shuffle the draw pile.) Tj T*
(- See the Future: look at the top 3 cards.) Tj T*
(- Nope: stop any action except an Exploding Kitten or a Defuse. A Nope can be Noped.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CAT CARDS AND COMBOS) Tj T*
(Cat cards have no power alone.) Tj T*
(- Two of a kind: steal a random card from another player.) Tj T*
(- Three of a kind: name a card; if the chosen player has it, they must give it to you.) Tj T*
(- Five different cards: take any card from the discard pile.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(The last player who has not exploded wins.) Tj T*
ET
